title: "vllm-single-gpu-slo-lab"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kuotunyu/vllm-single-gpu-slo-lab"
authors:
  - name: kuotunyu
abstract: >-
  SLO-bounded capacity, energy and quality measurements of Qwen3-8B on one desktop-shared
  RTX 4090 (vLLM 0.28, WSL2): four precisions (BF16, FP8, AWQ, GPTQ-Int4), three admission
  policies under a burst trace, and speculative decoding (n-gram, EAGLE-3), with bootstrap and
  Wilson confidence intervals; every number is rebuilt from committed evidence by make reproduce.
